        "summary": "Login Options",
        "description": "Initiate WebAuthn authentication for an existing device.\n\nThis endpoint returns WebAuthn assertion options and stores a one-time\nchallenge in Redis. The login flow is only valid for an active device.",
        "operationId": "login_options_api_v1_auth_login_options_post",
        "requestBody": {
